View CPU information and configure CPU governor, SMT, and scheduler settings.

Usage:
  spela cpu [command]

Available Commands:
  governor      Get or set CPU governor
  info          Show CPU information
  profile-reset Make a CPU profile field follow All games
  set           Set CPU profile for a game
  show          Show CPU profile for a game
  smt           Get or set SMT status

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for cpu

Use "spela cpu [command] --help" for more information about a command.
